<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Umgeni granted listing for new bond.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Umgeni granted listing for new bond.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Bond Exchange said on Monday it had granted a listing for water utility Umgeni Water's one billion rand UG65 bond.</p>
<p>It said the issue, the price of which would be determined by auction on September 3, would carry a 13 percent coupon paid semi-annually and mature on June 1 2010.</p>
<p>Interest dates would be June and December 1, with the first payment on December 1 1997, it added.  </p>
<p>BORROWER  UMGENI WATER</p>
<p>SPONSOR   RAND MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p>AMOUNT    ONE BLN RAND    COUPON 13 PCT	 MATURITY 1.JUN.10</p>
<p>TYPE	STRAIGHT	  PAY DATE 1.DEC.97   ISS PRICE TBA</p>
<p>LISTING   JHB</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
